  m_Name: AuntieDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNodeData
  lines:
  - Morning, Lucia. You slept well?
  - I was thinking... I have this book lying around...
  - I want you to fill it in with information on critters roaming around these lands.
  - You will have to catch them and all. Do not fret, I will teach you the basics!
    And if you ever need help, just know I'm right here.
  - Do you need any help?
